{
  "description": "This protocol automates the normalization of samples provided on four 96 well PCR plates. Normalization of achieved by dispensing custom volumes (specified in the uploaded csv file) of water to each well of the initial pcr plate with the single channel p20, followed by mixing, and then pooling of 5 ul sample aliquots into a separate tube (one for each plate) located in the 24 tube rack.\n\n\n\nOpentrons P20-single channel electronic pipettes (GEN2)\nOpentrons 20ul Filter Tips\ncsv file\nopentrons_24_tuberack_nest_2ml_screwcap\nnest_12_reservoir_15ml",
  "tags": [
    "Normalization",
    "Normalization and Pooling"
  ],
